<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Motor Service 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Motor Service 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		  2,374   vs	2,499</p>
<p>    Net			  31.82   vs	32.05</p>
<p>    Turnover		   5,850   vs	5,301</p>
<p>    Extraordinary    (loss)  247   vs (gain) 889</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>	     common stocks    11.0   vs	  12.0</p>
<p>	     preferred stocks 12.0   vs	  13.0</p>
<p>Note - Hyundai Motor Service Co, an affiliate of the Hyundai Group, said its share capital rose by 2.4 million to 14.67 million shares due to rights issue.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
